flowchart LR
    Camera[Camera trajectory] --> Mask[Noise and valid-frame masking]
    Subject[Subject trajectory and volume] --> Context[Projected subject context]
    Mask --> Encoder[Transformer encoder: 256 hidden, 8 heads, 4 layers]
    Context --> Encoder
    Queries[Ten fixed query codes] --> Encoder
    Encoder --> Logits[Shared 21D logits with field category masks]
    Logits --> Semantic[10 tokens: 93 probabilities, 117 fixed zeros]
    Labels[Ten categorical IDs and presence] --> Targets[Per-field one-hot targets]
    Targets --> CE[Masked cross-entropy]
    Logits --> CE
    Semantic --> Memory[Probability memory; fixed field codes only for attention]
    Targets --> Memory
    Memory --> Decoder[Transformer decoder: native K/V 21, hidden 256]
    Context --> Decoder
    Poses[Optional explicit keyframes] --> Decoder
    Decoder --> Output[Position3 and projected SVD9D rotation]
    Output --> Geometry[Pose and motion losses]
    Output --> Cycle[Re-encode generated trajectory]
    Cycle --> KL[KL original to cycle; original target detached]
    Semantic --> KL
    CE --> Loss[Total objective]
    Geometry --> Loss
    KL --> Loss
